(footprint "Seeed_Wio-SX1262"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "meshsat")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Seeed Studio Wio-SX1262 LoRa module (SKU 113990906 class), 11.6 x 11.0 x 2.95 mm, 12 castellated pads at 1.27 mm. Land pattern from the Wio-SX1262 Module Datasheet V1.1, section 5.1 figure 9 (recommended PCB footprint): pads 0.6 x 2.2 centred on the body edge, bottom row pins 1 to 8 at 1.33 + 1.27 k from the left edge (1.42 from the right), top row pins 12, 11, 10, 9 directly above bottom pads 2 to 5 (2.60 from the left edge, 5.23 from the right). Pin names (figure 2 table): 1 RF_SW, 2 MISO, 3 MOSI, 4 SCK, 5 NRST, 6 NSS, 7 GND, 8 VCC, 9 ANT (NC on the IPEX version, RF pad on the SMT-pin version), 10 GND, 11 BUSY, 12 DIO1; pin 1 bottom-left, numbered counter-clockwise seen from above. RF port: IPEX (U.FL) receptacle on the module top at its top-right corner beside pad 9, 50 ohm; the datasheet gives no antenna keep-out (the RF leaves by cable), keep copper off pad 9 and the corner under the IPEX unless the SMT-pin variant is fitted; TX/RX switch is the SX1262 DIO2. Source: https://files.seeedstudio.com/products/SenseCAP/Wio_SX1262/Wio-SX1262_Module_Datasheet.pdf (vendor/lora/seeed-wio-sx1262-module-datasheet-v1.1.pdf, V1.1)")
	(tags "Seeed Wio-SX1262 LoRa SX1262 module castellated")
